      "level": 1,
      "topic": "daily life",
      "title_zh": "弟弟的手",
      "title_en": "My little brother's hands",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["今天", "爸爸", "妈妈", "出去", "了", "，", "我", "和", "弟弟", "在家", "。"],
        ["他", "八", "岁", "。", "他", "很", "喜欢", "玩", "，", "不", "喜欢", "洗", "手", "。"],
        ["吃饭", "前", "，", "我", "说", "：", "“", "先", "洗", "手", "！", "”", "他", "说", "：", "“", "我", "的", "手", "很", "干净", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "看", "了", "看", "，", "他", "的", "手", "一", "点", "也", "不", "干净", "。", "最后", "，", "他", "还是", "去", "洗", "了", "。"],
        ["晚上", "妈妈", "回家", "，", "弟弟", "说", "：", "“", "今天", "我", "洗", "了", "很", "多", "次", "手", "！", "”", "妈妈", "笑", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Today Mum and Dad went out, and my little brother and I stayed at home.",
        "He's eight. He loves playing and hates washing his hands.",
        "Before we ate, I said: “Wash your hands first!” He said: “My hands are clean!”",
        "I had a look — his hands weren't clean at all. In the end he went and washed them.",
        "When Mum got home in the evening, my brother said: “I washed my hands loads of times today!” Mum laughed."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["在家", "弟弟", "干净"],
