      "title_zh": "网上的老衣服",
      "title_en": "Old clothes online",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "常", "在", "网上", "看", "老", "衣服", "。", "昨天", "，", "我", "看到", "了", "一些", "很", "好看", "的", "衣服", "。"],
        ["这些", "衣服", "是", "三十", "年", "前", "的", "。", "我", "想", "了", "一会儿", "，", "就", "买", "了", "。"],
        ["今天", "，", "衣服", "到", "了", "。", "我", "打开", "一", "看", "，", "有些", "大", "。"],
        ["我", "有些", "不", "高兴", "。", "我", "哥", "穿", "了", "穿", "，", "说", "：", "“", "很", "好", "！", "送", "我", "吧", "！", "”"],
        ["我", "笑", "了", "：", "“", "好", "，", "下次", "我", "买", "小", "一", "点", "的", "。", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I often look at vintage clothes online. Yesterday I saw some really nice ones.",
        "The clothes are thirty years old. I thought about it for a bit, then bought them.",
        "Today the clothes arrived. I opened the parcel — they were a bit big.",
        "I was a bit disappointed. My brother tried them on and said: “They’re great! Give them to me!”",
        "I laughed: “Fine — next time I’ll buy a smaller size.”"
      ],
      "names": [],
